      {
        "id": 46063,
        "name": "Shining the Holy Ark",
        "summary": "As the capable mercenary Arthur, you must summon every ounce of your role-playing prowess and lead your comrades on a do-or-die hunt for the kingdom's sacred artifacts. It's the RPG you've been waiting for, loaded with enough Medieval monsters and challenging \"four character\" control to stretch your role playing skills far beyond your wildest imagination.",
